id: pm-r8yytk
title: Shape-qualified scale baselines drifted from current CLI/SDK output contracts and supported runtime
description: "The committed scratch 10k scale budget still uses the legacy unqualified tier key and July output/startup observations. Exact-main and feature-branch runs now deterministically emit richer list/get payloads and exceed Node 24/26 cold mutation ceilings while all measured outputs remain below the 5k product target. Refreshing the baseline requires explicit cross-head evidence, the existing 25 percent methodology, and preservation of product ceilings."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[5]: "area:cli","area:performance","area:sdk",benchmark,regression
