completed_at: "2026-09-01T15:48:41.851Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: The scratch 10k budget is shape-qualified; exact-main and delivery-head results are compared on the supported Node 24 workflow baseline; a five-iteration delivery-head run establishes measured budgets with 25 percent headroom; the unmodified scale check passes; every command remains below the published 1000 ms p95 and 5000-token product targets; Node 26 variance is recorded without being misreported as a delivery regression.
parent: pm-9rxu
risk: high
confidence: high
severity: high
resolution: "Shape-qualified the scratch 10k tier, refreshed observations with five-run 25% headroom evidence, and documented supported-runtime baseline refresh requirements."
expected_result: The ordinary scale gate passes while retaining published 1000ms latency and 5000-token product ceilings.
actual_result: Exact-main and head outputs matched with no product failures; the final unmodified three-run Node 24 scale check passed.
